      "id": "text_oss_body",
      "x": 110, "y": 960,
      "width": 1220, "height": 55,
      "text": "kernel hot path  ·  multi-tenant seams (B-1..B-7)  ·  hot-reload kernel-swap  ·  JSON-lossless pipeline config\nServiceIdentityEnricher  ·  PropertyNamingPolicy  ·  provenance-gate slot  ·  sink [ModuleInitializer] registration\nLogEvent.GenSource field  ·  HmacChain math (canonical encoding)  ·  Apache 2.0",
      "originalText": "kernel hot path  ·  multi-tenant seams (B-1..B-7)  ·  hot-reload kernel-swap  ·  JSON-lossless pipeline config\nServiceIdentityEnricher  ·  PropertyNamingPolicy  ·  provenance-gate slot  ·  sink [ModuleInitializer] registration\nLogEvent.GenSource field  ·  HmacChain math (canonical encoding)  ·  Apache 2.0",
